# Line endings: text files normalised to LF in the repository; shell scripts must stay LF (they run on Linux
# servers), Windows checkouts may use CRLF for the rest.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.gd text
*.csv text
*.json text
*.md text

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pck binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
